Site and Studio rebuilt at this commit by the RE-PORT.md procedure: release engine and MCP
server, the WebAssembly package, the Studio re-record (RERECORD.md, selfcheck --final), every
site recorder, the MCP session (52 tools), build.py, check.py; ported from kshana-pro
site/desktop-studio b2ed1332 (site and Studio source, clean). web/capabilities.json, which web/
owns: the field-units proof reads 93 of 93 kinds, 3334 of 3334 numeric fields
(docs/field-units-schema.json).

New pages: docs/kind-tip-and-cue.html and docs/kinds-space-rf-survey.html (their figures in the palette colours, src/palette.rs).

Recorder diffs. No recorded figure moved: the site's recorded runs (assets/runs, the waterfall,
evidence, missions runs) differ only in the engine stamp 3395218 -> 0a53cb8, and their
result.json files are unchanged. The Studio's three LEO compatibility recordings (leo-band-trade,
xona-pulsar-signals, celeste-iod-classical-pilot-signals) each gain a gps-l2c victim row, from the
engine's GPS L2C addition after 0.40.0; every existing value in them is unchanged.

Pages whose numbers changed, by cause:
- Counts. Scenario kinds 92 -> 93: index, capabilities, editions, missions, docs/overview,
  architecture, scenarios, kinds, tutorials, capability-reference, capability-map, npm, rust, mcp,
  llms.txt and the search indexes. Kind families 13 -> 14. Scenario files 193 -> 195 (196 with the
  suite file on capabilities). MCP tools 49 -> 52: developers, missions, index, docs/overview.
- Build stamp 3395218 -> 0a53cb8: llms-full.txt, evidence, index, developers, run reports.
- Commit IDs cited in the engine's docs, re-pointed after the history rewrite: changelog,
  verification-matrix, modelled-rationale, capability-reference, evidence, kind-eo-coverage,
  kind-solar-system.
- Engine docs edited on main since the 0.40.0 build: commands, clock-log-formats,
  interference-map, machine-inputs, trust-telemetry, interop, leo-signal, surfaces, security,
  maritime-trust, test-bench, campaigns (the jamming phase now ends at 30.6 dB-Hz),
  kind-mission-thread, scenario-reference.
- Studio first-paint text of mission-thread-short ("Margin: 1.648." becomes a sentence naming
  the ascent phase); recording timings and sizes in the Studio's record indexes; the telemetry
  sample timestamps.

Checked: port --check (OK, 1128 files), web/site.test.mjs, legacy-urls.test.mjs, smoke.mjs,
every web/studio/lib test, and tests/scenario_count_doc_sync.rs and
readme_completeness_doc_sync.rs at this commit.
