-      <p class="lede">All 194 scenario files across 92 kinds, grouped by domain; 181 are bundled into the engine, and <code>celeste-iod-classical-pilot-signals</code>, <code>celeste-iod-end-to-end</code>, <code>celeste-iod-fused-pvt</code>, <code>leo-navmsg-celeste-iod</code>, <code>leo-pass-celeste-iod-multiband</code>, <code>lunar-descent-lola</code>, <code>lunar-llr-datum</code>, <code>lunar-station-coverage-terrain</code>, <code>lunar-station-geodesy-baseline</code>, <code>lunar-station-geodesy-with-station</code>, <code>lunar-surface-terrain</code>, <code>mission-thread-artemis-class</code>, <code>quantum-pnt-demonstrator.suite</code> run from the repository with the command line. The dot shows the ledger status of the kind's module where the ledger names it. A file with a recorded run opens it in Kshana Studio; the others open their entry in the scenario reference, with the file and the command that runs it.</p>
+      <p class="lede">All 196 scenario files across 93 kinds, grouped by domain; 181 are bundled into the engine, and <code>celeste-iod-classical-pilot-signals</code>, <code>celeste-iod-end-to-end</code>, <code>celeste-iod-fused-pvt</code>, <code>leo-navmsg-celeste-iod</code>, <code>leo-pass-celeste-iod-multiband</code>, <code>lunar-descent-lola</code>, <code>lunar-llr-datum</code>, <code>lunar-station-coverage-terrain</code>, <code>lunar-station-geodesy-baseline</code>, <code>lunar-station-geodesy-with-station</code>, <code>lunar-surface-terrain</code>, <code>mission-thread-artemis-class</code>, <code>quantum-pnt-demonstrator.suite</code>, <code>tip-and-cue-baltic-m2</code>, <code>tip-and-cue-short</code> run from the repository with the command line. The dot shows the ledger status of the kind's module where the ledger names it. A file with a recorded run opens it in Kshana Studio; the others open their entry in the scenario reference, with the file and the command that runs it.</p>
