bindex="-1" style="--c:var(--orb)"><i></i>Docker image</button><button role="tab" type="button" id="wt-jetbrains" aria-controls="wp-jetbrains" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" style="--c:var(--orb)"><i></i>JetBrains plugin</button></div></div><div class="wy-panels"><div class="wy-p" role="tabpanel" id="wp-browser" aria-labelledby="wt-browser"><h3 class="card-h">Kshana Studio</h3><p>Any bundled scenario, run on your machine as WebAssembly; nothing installed, nothing uploaded. Tune it, compare runs, sweep a parameter and export a reproducible report.</p><div class="wy-cmd"><a class="btn btn-ink" href="/studio/">Launch Kshana Studio <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="wy-p" role="tabpanel" id="wp-embed" aria-labelledby="wt-embed" hidden><h3 class="card-h">Embed mode</h3><p>Only Kshana Studio, for a course page or a report, with the scenario and view preselected</p><div class="wy-cmd"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/studio/?embed=1&amp;scenario=integrity-raim&amp;tab=timeseries">Open an embedded view <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><code class="wy-url">studio/index.html?embed=1&amp;scenario=integrity-raim&amp;tab=timeseries</code></div></div><div class="wy-p" role="tabpanel" id="wp-cli" aria-labelledby="wt-cli" hidden><h3 class="card-h">Command line</h3><p>kshana &lt;scenario&gt;.toml writes result.json, chart.svg and report.html</p><div class="wy-cmd"><button class="cmd" type="button" data-copy="cargo install kshana" aria-label="Copy: cargo install kshana"><span class="pr">$</span><span class="cmd-t">cargo install kshana</span><span class="cp"><svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-copy"/></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="wy-p" role="tabpanel" id="wp-ci" aria-labelledby="wt-ci" hidden><h3 class="card-h">CI regression</h3><p>Output is deterministic from scenario, seed and engine version, so a committed result.json is a regression test (CI: continuous integration): re