+<td>maps any CSV, TSV, JSON or JSON Lines export to a <code>kshana.obs/1</code> file through a mapping file, with no code</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect map examples/connect/timing-monitor.csv --mapping examples/connect/timing-monitor.connect.toml --station examples/obs/station.toml</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect check &lt;vector.toml|dir&gt; [--bless]</code></td>
+<td>runs Connect conformance vectors (input, mapping or reader, expected obs/1 output) and fails on any byte difference, naming the first differing line</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect check conformance/connect</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect watch &lt;dir&gt; --mapping &lt;connect.toml&gt; --station &lt;station.toml&gt; [--suffix &lt;.csv&gt;] [--interval &lt;s&gt;] [--once]</code></td>
+<td>follows a directory of growing or rotating logs and prints new <code>kshana.obs/1</code> records as JSON lines, reading the files as one continuous log</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect watch logs/ --mapping examples/connect/android-raw.connect.toml --station examples/obs/station.toml --once</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect mqtt &lt;host:port&gt; --topic &lt;filter&gt; --mapping &lt;connect.toml&gt; --station &lt;station.toml&gt; [--header &lt;row&gt;] [--qos 0|1] [--user &lt;name&gt; --password-env &lt;VAR&gt;] [--client-id &lt;id&gt;] [--max-messages &lt;n&gt;]</code></td>
+<td>subscribes to an MQTT topic and prints <code>kshana.obs/1</code> records as JSON lines as the published rows complete each epoch</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect mqtt 127.0.0.1:1883 --topic gnss/rx1/raw --mapping examples/connect/android-raw.connect.toml --station examples/obs/station.toml --header &quot;$(grep &#39;^type,&#39; examples/connect/android-raw.csv)&quot;</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect nats &lt;host:port&gt; --subject &lt;s&gt; --mapping &lt;connect.toml&gt; --station &lt;station.toml&gt; [--header &lt;row&gt;] [--per-topic] [--user &lt;name&gt; --password-env &lt;VAR&gt; | --token-env &lt;VAR&gt;] [--max-messages &lt;n&gt;]</code></td>
+<td>subscribes to a NATS subject and prints <code>kshana.obs/1</code> records as JSON lines</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect nats 127.0.0.1:4222 --subject &#39;gnss.*.raw&#39; --per-topic --mapping examples/connect/timing-monitor.connect.toml --station examples/obs/station.toml --header &quot;week;tow;lat;lon;alt_ft;G05;G12;G25;E11;agc;spoof&quot;</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect ws &lt;ws://host:port/path&gt; --mapping &lt;connect.toml&gt; --station &lt;station.toml&gt; [--header &lt;row&gt;] [--max-messages &lt;n&gt;]</code></td>
+<td>reads rows streamed over a WebSocket and prints <code>kshana.obs/1</code> records as JSON lines; the server&#39;s close ends the run</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect ws ws://127.0.0.1:9000/raw --mapping examples/connect/android-raw.connect.toml --station examples/obs/station.toml --header &quot;$(grep &#39;^type,&#39; examples/connect/android-raw.csv)&quot;</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect check-live &lt;vector.toml|dir&gt; [--json]</code></td>
+<td>replays the Connect conformance vectors over MQTT (with a forced reconnection), WebSocket and the directory watch; checks order, holding, reconnection and latency; exit 1 on any failure</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect check-live conformance/connect</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect load-test [--stations &lt;n&gt;] [--rate &lt;Hz&gt;] [--seconds &lt;s&gt;] [--via memory|mqtt] [--json]</code></td>
+<td>runs many synthetic stations through the live feeds (default 1,000 at 1 Hz for 10 s); reports capacity and time per message; exit 1 if it does not keep up</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect load-test --via mqtt</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/CONNECT.md">Connect</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>kshana connect adapters &lt;list|check&gt; [&lt;dir&gt;] [--json]</code></td>
+<td>the adapter registry: lists the adapters that pass, or validates every manifest and runs every conformance vector (exit 1 on any failure)</td>
+<td><code>kshana connect adapters check adapters</code></td>
+<td><a href="https://github.com/ashfordeOU/kshana/blob/main/docs/ADAPTERS.md">Adapters</a></td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
 <td><code>kshana osnma verify &lt;input&gt;</code></td>
 <td>which satellites&#39; navigation data a receiver can authenticate</td>
 <td><code>kshana osnma verify examples/osnma/pages-good.txt --public-key &quot;$(cat examples/osnma/public-key.txt)&quot; --json</code></td>
