+<td><code>kshana iq scene</code>, <code>acquire</code>, <code>track</code>, <code>sweep</code>, <code>labfit</code>, <code>campaign</code>, <code>conditions</code>, <code>frontend</code>, <code>monitor</code>, <code>inventory</code>, <code>info</code>, <code>extract</code>, <code>convert</code>, <code>decimate</code>, <code>record</code></td>
