 <h1 id="localisation-of-the-engine">Localisation of the engine</h1>
 <p>The engine&#39;s human-facing text is in 17 languages beside English: nl, pl, pt-BR, pt-PT, fi, sv, da, nb, cs, uk,
@@ -170,7 +170,7 @@ byte-identity proof per writer.</p>
 fetches <code>i18n/&lt;lang&gt;/engine.ftl</code> on a language choice and calls <code>register_catalogue(tag, text)</code>; if the fetch or
 the registration fails the page stays in English. Native, the command line and the Python wheel embed all 18.</p>
 <p>Size, unoptimised <code>.wasm</code> from <code>cargo build --release --target wasm32-unknown-unknown --features wasm --lib</code>
-(before wasm-bindgen and wasm-opt), base bc04e98f against this branch: 18.71 MB -&gt; 19.88 MB raw, 5.43 MB -&gt;
+(before wasm-bindgen and wasm-opt), base 68e8632b against this branch: 18.71 MB -&gt; 19.88 MB raw, 5.43 MB -&gt;
 5.79 MB gzip, +357 kB gzip. The English catalogue is 521 kB raw, 153 kB gzip of it; the rest is <code>fluent-bundle</code>
 and its dependencies. This is accepted as measured.</p>
