+<li><strong>MODELLED</strong> Cold-atom interferometer accelerometer from first principles (k_eff·T², QPN). Oracle (ExternalDataset): Published CAI primary-paper numeric vectors (Cheinet 2008 transfer function; Peters/Freier sensitivity): k_eff·T² matched exactly, shot-noise ASD a one-sided floor within ~2× of each published instrument (real devices carry technical noise above the quantum floor). A bracket, not parity. 0.30 round 2 (pre-registered e7de532a), a finding (stays MODELLED): the QPN-only rotation noise against the measured Gauguet et al.</li>
