apabilities that is the single source of truth for every label." width="100%" loading="lazy"><img class="theme-dark" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%221280%22 height=%22620%22 viewBox=%220 0 1280 620%22 role=%22img%22 aria-labelledby=%22t d%22%3E%3Ctitle id=%22t%22%3EArchitecture: front doors, one dispatch, eight layers, one ledger%3C/title%3E%3Cdesc id=%22d%22%3EKshana's architecture in layers. Five front doors (command line, Python, JavaScript and WebAssembly, the MCP server and the JetBrains plugin) reach one api::run_toml, a typed dispatch over 92 kinds. Beneath it sit eight domain layers: Time and frames (timescales · jd2 · precession, nutation · cio · frames · eop); Clocks and timing (allan · clock_state · holdover, telecom_timing · slot_timing); Inertial and fusion (inertial · fusion · kalman, mapmatch · gravimeter · altpnt); GNSS and integrity (gnss_sim · pvt · raim · sbas, jamming · spectrum · spoof_*); Astrodynamics (sgp4 · tle · propagator · forces, orbit_determination · maneuver); LEO PNT (leo_signal · leo_pass, leo_navmsg · leo_fusion · chain); Moon, Mars, deep space (lunar_* · mars_pnt · radiometric, deepspace_od · ccsds_tdm); Missions and studies (campaign · constellation, passes · resilience · study). All of them rest on a shared core (types, scenario, the run record) and are cross-referenced by the verification module, the machine-checked matrix of 401 capabilities that is the single source of truth for every VALIDATED, MODELLED or PARTNER label.%3C/desc%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cpattern id=%22dots1%22 width=%2222%22 height=%2222%22 patternUnits=%22userSpaceOnUse%22%3E%3Ccircle cx=%2211%22 cy=%2211%22 r=%221.1%22 fill=%22%23171E2D%22/%3E%3C/pattern%3E%3Cpath id=%22m50%22 d=%22M24 0 232 710H368L576 0H467L300 601L133 0ZM140 185 172 282H428L460 185Z%22/%3E%3Cpath id=%22m51%22 d=%22M67 0V710H288Q401 710 466 653Q530 596 530 498Q530 447 508 408Q485 369 448 347Q412 325 371 322L367 334Q441 331 478 301Q514 270 