 <div class="ref-card" id="lunar-orbit-rendezvous-elfo"><h3>lunar-orbit-rendezvous-elfo.toml</h3><div class="ref-meta"><span>kind lunar-orbit-rendezvous</span><span>not matched to a ledger module by name</span></div><p>Lunar rendezvous in an elliptical polar orbit: relative navigation for an Orion-lander style docking in a 100 km by 3000 km polar orbit with periapsis over the south pole (Artemis-class), with a lunar gravity field and LunaNet-style signals.</p><pre data-lang="scenario · toml"><code class="hljs language-ini"><span class="hljs-attr">kind</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;lunar-orbit-rendezvous&quot;</span>
