         <div class="ed-why"><span class="ed-l">Why everyone needs it</span><p>Anyone who takes position or time from GNSS (Global Navigation Satellite Systems) is exposed: jamming, spoofing and signal loss reach vehicles, networks, grids and spacecraft alike. The open core shows how exposed, and says which figures are checked.</p></div>
