ond (B2). Scope, stated narrowly: self-generated test certificates and tokens, made by the same OpenSSL that judges them; OpenSSL is an independent implementation, not a timestamp authority; no public authority's token is vendored (freetsa.org states no licence). Nothing here attests any real timestamp | evidence::tsa (verify_token, pem_certificates); evidence::verify (VerifyOptions::tsa_anchors, Failure::TimestampAuthorityInvalid); evidence::cli (--tsa-ca) |
