+## Adding an adapter#
+
+A device or log format that Kshana can read through a mapping file is added as an adapter: one folder under adapters/, with no change to the engine. The folder holds an adapter.toml, the mapping file, a sample you may share (no customer or personal data), and a conformance vector with its expected output. Run kshana connect adapters check adapters before opening the pull request: it validates the manifest and runs the vector, and CI runs the same check. The details are in docs/ADAPTERS.md. The licensing above applies to adapters too.
