pheric delay over the reference signal's, (f_ref/f)^2\",\n      \"provenance\": \"closed-form\",\n      \"unit\": \"1\"\n    },\n    \"trade.rows[].jitter_equal_cn0_m\": {\n      \"note\": \"ranging accuracy at the receiver's reference C/N0 for every signal\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"m\"\n    },\n    \"trade.rows[].jitter_equal_eirp_m\": {\n      \"note\": \"ranging accuracy at that C/N0\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"m\"\n    },\n    \"trade.rows[].matched_js_max_equal_eirp_db\": {\n      \"note\": \"matched-noise J/S tolerance at the equal-EIRP C/N0\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB\"\n    },\n    \"trade.rows[].tx_bandwidth_hz\": {\n      \"note\": \"transmit bandwidth\",\n      \"provenance\": \"spec\",\n      \"unit\": \"Hz\"\n    },\n    \"trade.rows[].wideband_js_max_equal_eirp_db\": {\n      \"note\": \"wideband-noise J/S tolerance at the equal-EIRP C/N0\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB\"\n    },\n    \"trade.slant_range_km\": {\n      \"note\": \"slant range of the free-space loss\",\n      \"provenance\": \"input\",\n      \"unit\": \"km\"\n    },\n    \"trade.slant_tec_tecu\": {\n      \"note\": \"slant total electron content, 1 TECU = 1e16 electrons/m^2\",\n      \"provenance\": \"input\",\n      \"unit\": \"TECU\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"evidence\": {\n    \"id_rule\": \"the stable id of the matrix row (the ID column): VM- and 8 hex digits, issued once and never reassigned\",\n    \"matrix\": \"docs/VERIFICATION-MATRIX.md\",\n    \"rows\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"VM-cf3cdcd3\",\n        \"requirement\": \"Reproducibility & software assurance\",\n        \"status\": \"MODELLED\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"VM-25c2d93d\",\n        \"requirement\": \"Band-limited closed forms for any ranging signal: power in band and early-late code-tracking jitter against published values, with the Gabor bandwidth and offset spectral separation cr