38.0,233.6 812.0,256.1 886.0,278.6 960.0,301.1 \" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A5C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polyline points=\"590.0,252.0 664.0,274.5 738.0,297.0 812.0,319.5 886.0,342.0 960.0,364.5 \" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F45CCB\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"992\" y=\"554\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#8190B0\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Geist, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif\">Kshana v0.40.0 · scenario 34a6b3211c13 · kshana.dev</text><metadata id=\"kshana-evidence\" data-tier=\"MODELLED\" data-rows=\"VM-cf3cdcd3;VM-25c2d93d;VM-46b52315;VM-3fce7cff\">VM-cf3cdcd3 MODELLED Reproducibility &amp; software assurance | VM-25c2d93d VALIDATED Band-limited closed forms for any ranging signal: power in band and early-late code-tracking jitter against published values, with the Gabor bandwidth and offset spectral separation cross-checked | VM-46b52315 VALIDATED Maximum Doppler of a low Earth orbit navigation satellite, which sizes the acquisition search | VM-3fce7cff MODELLED Low Earth orbit positioning, navigation and timing signal designs: code tracking, acquisition, GNSS compatibility and a band trade for any system</metadata><rect x=\"0\" y=\"560\" width=\"1000\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#060A14\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"571\" fill=\"#8190B0\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Geist, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif\">Evidence: MODELLED · 4 ledger rows VM-cf3cdcd3 VM-25c2d93d VM-46b52315 +1 more</text></svg>","csv":null,"exports":{}}
