hen the bands do not overlap\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB(1/Hz)\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].chip_rate_hz\": {\n      \"note\": \"spreading-code chip rate; null for a flat (OFDM-like) spectrum\",\n      \"provenance\": \"spec\",\n      \"unit\": \"Hz\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].code_length_chips\": {\n      \"note\": \"spreading-code length\",\n      \"provenance\": \"spec\",\n      \"unit\": \"chip\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].code_period_s\": {\n      \"note\": \"code length over chip rate\",\n      \"provenance\": \"closed-form\",\n      \"unit\": \"s\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].data_rate_sps\": {\n      \"note\": \"data (symbol) rate\",\n      \"provenance\": \"spec\",\n      \"unit\": \"symbol/s\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].fdma_offsets_hz[]\": {\n      \"note\": \"frequency-division multiple access sub-carrier offsets from the band centre\",\n      \"provenance\": \"spec\",\n      \"unit\": \"Hz\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].fdma_shares[]\": {\n      \"note\": \"power share of each sub-carrier\",\n      \"provenance\": \"spec\",\n      \"unit\": \"1\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].first_null_hz\": {\n      \"note\": \"first positive null of the unfiltered unit-area PSD, located numerically (half the width for a flat spectrum)\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"Hz\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].gabor_bandwidth_closed_form_hz\": {\n      \"note\": \"BPSK closed form sqrt([B/2 - sin(pi B Tc)/(2 pi Tc)]/(pi^2 Tc eta)); null otherwise\",\n      \"provenance\": \"closed-form\",\n      \"unit\": \"Hz\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].gabor_bandwidth_hz\": {\n      \"note\": \"RMS (Gabor) bandwidth of the component's baseband spectrum inside the transmit band\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"Hz\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].in_band_power_fraction\": {\n      \"note\": \"fraction of the component's power the transmit band passes, integrated numerically over every sub-carrier\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"1\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].in_band_power_fraction_closed_form\": {\n      \"note\": \"BPSK closed form (2/pi)[Si(pi B Tc) - sin^2(pi B Tc/2)/(pi B Tc/2)], for a BPSK component at the centre; null otherwise\",\n      \"provenance\": \"closed-form\",\n      \"unit\": \"1\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].components[].power_fraction\": {\n      \"note\": \"component share of the unfiltered power\",\n      \"provenance\": \"spec\",\n      \"unit\": \"1\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].in_band_power_fraction\": {\n      \"note\": \"fraction eta of the unfiltered power inside the transmit band, sum of share x component fraction\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"1\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].jammer_tolerance.cw_js_max_db\": {\n      \"note\": \"largest J/S of a CW tone at the carrier before the tracked component reaches the threshold (J over the tracked power)\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].jammer_tolerance.matched_js_max_db\": {\n      \"note\": \"the same for noise matched to the tracked component's spectrum\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].jammer_tolerance.reference_cn0_dbhz\": {\n      \"note\": \"total in-band C/N0 the tolerance starts from\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB-Hz\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].jammer_tolerance.tracking_threshold_dbhz\": {\n      \"note\": \"threshold the tolerance runs to\",\n      \"provenance\": \"input\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB-Hz\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].jammer_tolerance.wideband_js_max_db\": {\n      \"note\": \"the same for flat noise over the transmit band\",\n      \"provenance\": \"computed\",\n      \"unit\": \"dB\"\n    },\n    \"signals[].orbit_altitude_m\": {\n      \"note\": \"constellation orbit altitude given by the